<subsection xml:id="sec-internet-resources">
  <title>Available Through the Internet</title>

<p>
  <alert>The following resources are not managed by Midland College.  They have been found to generally be accurate mathematically but may not be enitrely accessible to all viewers.</alert>
</p>
